# This file carries no variables, and it cannot: `vite dev` runs the Worker in
# workerd, whose environment is built from the Worker's own vars rather than
# from a .env file or from the shell.
#
# The Rails origin is `RAILS_ORIGIN`, per tier in wrangler.jsonc; no tier names
# one yet. To reach the development container's Rails locally, set it in
# `.dev.vars` — see `.dev.vars.example` and adr/018-core-rails-direct-internet.md.
#
# Cloudflare Access service-token credentials are consumed only by
# scripts/check-tunnel and never by the application runtime.
